        "Description": "Sniper Nest: Winery Viewpoint\r\rChallenges:\r\rByrned Out  -  Assassinate Joseph Byrne by shooting him into the water.\rDown To Earth  -  Assassinate Fernando Castaglione by shooting him off a cliff.\rThe Grape Escape  -  Assassinate Gervasio Correa without hiding his body.\rGreenhouse Effect  -  Hide two targets in bushes.\rMindblowing  -  Assassinate all targets with headshots.\rClowning Around  -  Assassinate all targets while wearing a clown suit.\r\rGood luck!",
